<p>Dear <%= @invite.name %>,</p>

<p style="text-align: center; font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 28px; margin: 24px 0 8px;">Save the Date</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">We're getting married, and we'd love for you to be there.</p>

<% if (dates = wedding_dates(@events)) || WEDDING[:location].present? %>
  <div class="event-card" style="text-align: center;">
    <% if dates %><p class="event-name"><%= dates %></p><% end %>
    <% if WEDDING[:location].present? %><p class="event-details"><%= WEDDING[:location] %></p><% end %>
  </div>
<% end %>

<p>A formal invitation will follow. In the meantime, our website has travel details and more, and it's where you'll RSVP once invitations go out.</p>

<div class="btn-wrapper">
  <a href="<%= @site_url %>" class="btn">Visit Our Website</a>
</div>

<div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 24px;">
  <%= image_tag attachments["rsvp-qr-code.png"].url, alt: "QR code linking to our wedding website", width: 150, height: 150 %>
  <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #8A8A8A; margin: 4px 0 0;">Or scan with your phone</p>
</div>
